<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>啟用</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>修改任意選項都會即時生效，無需 respring。關閉總開關會立即恢復原生狀態欄圖標。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>enabled</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>啟用 Duo 狀態欄</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>整體大小與位置</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>圖標以狀態欄右側原生區域為基準排布：一個完整的圓（頂弧＝電量，底部缺口＝訊號點，圓心＝Wi-Fi）。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>1.0</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>0.5</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>1.8</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>scale</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>圖標整體大小（1.0＝標準 · 0.5＝最小 · 1.8＝最大）</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>0</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>-60</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>60</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>offsetX</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>左右位置（負值＝向左，正值＝向右，單位 pt）</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>0</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>-30</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>30</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>offsetY</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>上下位置（負值＝向上，正值＝向下，單位 pt）</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>圓環</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>圓環顯示當前電量百分比；充電時整圈變綠色，平時跟隨狀態欄顏色（深色背景白色、淺色背景黑色）。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>2.6</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>1.0</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>4.5</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>ringWidth</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>圓環線條粗細</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>-0.5</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>-4</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>4</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>wifiOffset</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>圓心 Wi-Fi／文字 上下位置（負值＝偏上）</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>訊號點</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>圓環底部缺口上的四個圓點＝主卡訊號強度（0-4 格實時顯示）。無 Wi-Fi 時圓心會顯示 5G／4G。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSSliderCell</string>
            <key>default</key>
            <real>1.5</real>
            <key>min</key>
            <real>0.8</real>
            <key>max</key>
            <real>3.0</real>
            <key>showValue</key>
            <true/>
            <key>defaults</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus</string>
            <key>key</key>
            <string>dotSize</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>訊號圓點大小</string>
            <key>PostNotification</key>
            <string>com.shuijia.duostatus/preferencesChanged</string>
        </dict>

        <dict>
            <key>cell</key>
            <string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key>
            <string>關於</string>
            <key>footerText</key>
            <string>DuoStatusBar 1.3.0 · iPhone Duo 風格狀態欄 · 源碼與更新：github.com/Walter498/Duo</string>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
